## Design

The application starts from a `sap.fe.core.fpm` Custom Page. Standard Filter Bar and Table Building Blocks are used first. Any direct region is client-side only and must not replace backend rules, authorization, or transactions.

## Run

```bash
npm install
npm start
```

`npm start` opens the local FLP Sandbox at `test/flpSandbox.html`. Use `npm run start-noflp` for the standalone `index.html` preview.

